------------------------------------------------------------------
PATH / DECOMPOSITION DEVIATIONS (declared)
------------------------------------------------------------------
The prompt's templated native path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/` does
not exist in this repo. The iOS/macOS app targets compile from `apps/apple/Sources/`
(XcodeGen `project.yml`, sources: [Sources, Localization, ../design/generated/apple]).
A file under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/` would NOT be compiled into any target. The
surface was therefore placed in the real build tree, mirroring the web feature path
`features/dashboard/widgets/`:

  apps/apple/Sources/Dashboard/Widgets/ChargeHistoryProjection.swift   (domain + pure adapter + state)
  apps/apple/Sources/Dashboard/Widgets/ChargeHistoryWidgetModel.swift  (seams + @Observable model)
  apps/apple/Sources/Dashboard/Widgets/ChargeHistoryWidget.swift       (SwiftUI surface + previews)

Decomposed into three cohesive files because SwiftLint `--strict` enforces the
repo's 400-line file_length limit (longest pre-existing file is 390; no file uses
a disable directive). A single monolith linted at 759 lines. The repo guidance
explicitly prefers decomposition over monoliths.

Tests live under the test target's source root `apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Dashboard/`
(required by the "adapter + per-state + a11y" acceptance criterion).

------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY SUMMARY (vs web source)
------------------------------------------------------------------
- Data: useVehicles (default vehicle id) + recent-10 charging query, bound via an
  injected ChargeHistoryDataSource seam (P1/S8 state-holder plugs in) — no I/O in the view.
- Projection: total_energy_added_wh (SI) -> kWh via ChargeEnergyUnit.fromSI, `.reverse()`
  to oldest->newest, hasChartData == count > 1 (web `chartData.length > 1`); Total/Avg stats.
- Layout: full 2x4 = Total/Avg + green (#10b981 ~ chartSeriesBattery / palette idx 2)
  TSAreaChart; compact (cols<=1) = summary only. Registry: id `charge-history`,
  category `charging`, default 2x4 / min 2x2 / max 4x40 (clamped).
- States rendered: loading, content, empty ("No charge sessions yet"), error (QueryError
  equivalent + retry), stale chip + auto-refresh, offline chip + cached value.
- i18n: all strings via LocalizedStringKey -> Localizable.xcstrings (13 new keys, ar/en/he).
- a11y: VoiceOver labels/values on panel, stats, chart, refresh; decorative icons hidden;
  Dynamic Type via Font.TS ramp; reduce-motion honored by shared chart/feedback components.
- Telemetry: view.opened with slug "ChargeHistoryWidget" via ChargeHistoryDiagnostics seam
  (fired once on appear).

